    {
      "heading": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "新學年第一學期遠距教學\nRemote Learning Fall 2020"
      }
    },
    {
      "richtext": "由於加州新冠肺炎疫情加重，聖地牙哥多個學區已經決定下學\n年\n遠\n距教學。我們學校也決定在2020-2021學年的第一學期實行遠距教學，第二學期將視當時疫情情況再做決定。\nDue to the increase in COVID-19 cases in California, many school districts in San Diego have decided to implement remote learning for the next school year. Our school has decided to implement remote learning for the first semester of the 2020-2021 school year. We will decide what to do regarding the second semester based on the situation of the epidemic later on."
    },
